# Per-release erhai suites that exist ONLY for local build+test so far.
# A directory listed here is generated and signed by ./update-ppa.sh
# (--no-push for a purely local refresh) but can never be committed by
# `git add -A`, so a normal publish cannot push an untested package live.
# (none right now: the stonking suite is a REAL suite as of 2026-10-27 -- the
#  stonking image ships main + stonking in its sources, so the suite has to be
#  published together with the debs that live in it)
